{"id": "69372", "title": "暖光", "author": "颜凉雨", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69372.htm", "intro": "沈盟的身上似乎有个情感自动反馈系统，\r\n 你对他好一点，他就会不自觉的对你好很多点。\r\n 只是这好朴实得过了头，十个人里九个都会忽略。\r\n 王朝倒是个识货的人，可他巴不得自己眼拙，\r\n 诱拐高风亮节且意志坚定的朴素小老百姓，\r\n 呃……很有难度。\r\n 日光灯的温度很微弱，可开着它，心就是暖的。\r\n 尤其是在房间亮起的刹那。\r\n ——————————————————————————\r\n 冬天里嘛，就写个暖点的故事。这回不走清凉路线了啊~~o(∩_∩)o\r\n PS.此文不开放转载，如果有转载了的亲，麻烦撤文，辛苦啦~~~", "base": "files/article/html/69/69372", "chapters": [{"title": "第 1 章", "file": "10616373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "10616374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "10616375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "10616376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "10616377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "10616378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "10616379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "10616380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "10616381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "10616382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-14", "file": "10616383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-19", "file": "10616384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10616385.html", "available": false}]}